{'symbol': 'GILD', 'date': '2022-10-03 09:00:00', 'title': 'KITE RECEIVES U.S. FDA APPROVAL OF VIRAL VECTOR MANUFACTURING FACILITY IN SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA TO PRODUCE COMMERCIAL PRODUCT', 'text': "SANTA MONICA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--KITE, A GILEAD COMPANY (NASDAQ: GILD), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) HAS APPROVED THE COMPANY'S RETROVIRAL VECTOR (RVV) MANUFACTURING FACILITY IN OCEANSIDE, CALIFORNIA, FOR COMMERCIAL PRODUCTION. VIRAL VECTORS ARE KEY COMPONENTS NEEDED TO MANUFACTURE KITE'S CELL THERAPIES TO TREAT CERTAIN BLOOD CANCERS. KITE IS THE ONLY CELL THERAPY COMPANY WITH IN-HOUSE COMMERCIAL AND CLINICAL TRIAL VIRAL VECTOR MANUFACTURING CAPABILITIES, AU"}